---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ConsoleFooter from "../components/layout/ConsoleFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Security policy — SJSU NSIN"
  description="Responsible disclosure policy for sjsunsin.org."
  theme="console"
>
  <section class="pt-40 pb-28">
    <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10">
      <h1 class="t-h1 text-paper mb-10">Responsible disclosure</h1>

      <p class="t-body text-paper/70 mb-6">
        We appreciate the security research community&rsquo;s work in helping us
        keep <code>sjsunsin.org</code> safe. If you believe you have found a
        vulnerability, please report it through one of the contacts below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="t-h3 text-paper mt-14 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <ul class="t-body text-paper/70 space-y-2">
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:security@sjsunsin.org" class="link text-paper">security@sjsunsin.org</a></li>
        <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/sjsu-nsin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link text-paper">SJSU NSIN</a></li>
        <li>Machine-readable: <a href="/.well-known/security.txt" class="link text-paper">/.well-known/security.txt</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3 text-paper mt-14 mb-4">Scope</h2>
      <p class="t-body text-paper/70 mb-4">In scope:</p>
      <ul class="t-body text-paper/70 list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-6">
        <li>Stored or reflected XSS on <code>sjsunsin.org</code></li>
        <li>Domain or subdomain takeover</li>
        <li>Supply-chain issues in declared dependencies</li>
        <li>Sensitive information disclosure in committed code</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="t-body text-paper/70 mb-4">Out of scope:</p>
      <ul class="t-body text-paper/70 list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-6">
        <li>Volumetric DDoS reports (handled upstream)</li>
        <li>Lack of rate-limiting on a static site</li>
        <li>Automated scanner output without a working proof of concept</li>
        <li>Missing best-practice headers without demonstrated impact</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3 text-paper mt-14 mb-4" id="acknowledgments">Acknowledgments</h2>
      <p class="t-body text-paper/70">
        Researchers who report valid issues will be credited here, with their
        permission. We disclose vulnerabilities publicly after they are
        remediated, typically within 90 days of the initial report.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ConsoleFooter />
</BaseLayout>
